pipe Tanks

box alice as Alice
box usdc as USDC
box bob as Bob

hold alice: 100 USDC
hold bob: 0 USDC

step USDC moves a balance
  say USDC moves 10 from Alice to Bob. The move is pending.
  alice -> usdc: send
  move usdc: 10 alice -> bob

step The call returns
  say The outermost call returns, and the move becomes final.
  return usdc: true
